00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:17.751
I've known him he's

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:18.485
been my friend,

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:21.121
my close family friend for 40 years.

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:22.889
And, you know, there's

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:25.058
nothing personal about this campaign.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:27.527
I am not a mean spirited campaign.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.695
In our personal campaign

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.863
