00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:18.311
a lot of people would support him.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.513
So I think it really

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:20.780
you know,

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.282
the only question that we have

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:23.616
when you get to a certain age is

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:25.218
